@startuml seq-b-failover
title Вариант B. Failover на Temporal: таймер истёк -> SMS
autonumber
participant "Temporal\nCluster" as T
participant "DeliveryWorkflow\n(worker)" as W
participant "Activity\nworkers" as A
participant "SMS-агрегатор A" as SA
participant "SMS-агрегатор B" as SB
participant "Receipt\nGateway" as G
participant "Мобильное\nприложение" as App

W -> T : await Signal("delivered"), timer 10 с
... 10 секунд без сигнала (устройство офлайн) ...
T -> W : TimerFired
W -> T : ExecuteActivity(SendSMS, attempt=2,\nRetryPolicy{max=3, backoff=100ms x2})
T -> A : activity task
A -> SA : send(client_msg_id=attempt#2)
SA --> A : 503
A -> SB : send(client_msg_id=attempt#2)\n(провайдерный failover внутри activity)
SB --> A : 200
A --> T : completed(provider=B)
W -> T : await Signal("delivered"), timer 60 с
SB -> G : DLR delivered
G -> T : SignalWorkflow(delivered{attempt=2})
T -> W : signal
W -> T : CompleteWorkflow(DELIVERED via SMS)
== Позднее подтверждение push ==
App -> G : POST /acks {attempt#1}
G -> T : SignalWorkflow(...)
T --> G : NotFound (workflow завершён)
G --> App : 200 {show: false}
note over W : Если activity-воркер упал во время SendSMS,\nTemporal перезапустит activity по таймауту.\nЗащита от двойной SMS — client_msg_id у провайдера
@enduml
